<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">-Omusebezi no Kutoloka Ebibele no Siluyana</book>
  <para style="h">JUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo lya Juda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">ELIN̄OLO OKUTUNDA KWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDA</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Elin̄olo liisaniwa Juda kama lina kutumbiwa elitina lya woyo ona ku lin̄ola. Juda kame akulimukisa yonyene nji ni minaye Jakobo, woyo neli minaye Jesu. Cwale kame kulumeliwa nji niyonyene ni munjili no ainaye Jesu (1). Katulimukile nji eli lin̄olo kame lina kun̄olelwa fela ku Keleke imweya mi omu ni mulibaka no lin̄olo elyo ana kubapanya nalyo mu Testamende no kale, okubala kwaye Juda no matate kelo kame kuna kutendiwa ni ma Juda. Mu mukwa no ngeso nakun̄olela elin̄olo lyaye kwao “Onje ana kwisaniwa, ao asingiwa kwa Nyambe ni ku babalelwa kwa Jesu Kilesite” (1) Elin̄olo kame limonahala nji kama lina kun̄oliwa kuma 60 munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite.</para>
  <para style="ip">Elibaka elyo ana kun̄olela eli n̄olo eli ni kuba emamela kwa sikulumela onje nji alese okulyanga nisiwa kwa sikwiyeta no mapwa (Juda 4). Kame ana kuibapanya ni Testamende no kale nji aongotete eyo aamba. Eli lin̄olo kame likutabela eyambo ni lin̄olo lya 2 Petolosi okubeeka mane neyi no asikwiyeta no mapwa (Juda 4; 2 Pitolosi 2.1) kame ni kubapanya ni yambo no Mangeloi ni Sodoma ni Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no yambo</para>
  <para style="io">Kuma tatekelo Juda kame aamba kwa sikubala (1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Esi sitatamako, kame aba elibaka no kun̄ola eyi ebuka mi ni kuba emamela kwa sikwiyeta no mapwa (3-4)</para>
  <para style="io">Munyma yeyo kame aba emyanda okutunda kwaanu mane niinu injili eyo inakutendahala mu Testamende no kale (5-16)</para>
  <para style="io">Cwale kame aambela omo afanena okutambulele ku mamela eyo anaabi (17-23).</para>
  <para style="io">Kumamaneneno kame ayatila elin̄olo mu kulumbeka Nyambe (24-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa meene omubika wa Jesu Kilesite ni minaye Jakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Kwaawo, aa asingwa ana isaniwa,mwa Nyambe Sitange ni Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="JUD 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Amakeke, kozo ni lilato iikale naanyi.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aiyeti no Mapwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Aasingwa, kame ni shukele oku mi n̄olela kweyi noku yoyisiwa kwetu, kame na wana nji kwautokwa oku ming'olela ni ku mikumbela nji mu kongote ku tumelo eyo ina kubiwa kwaanu a Nyambe oweli. Mi omucima usini kandiketa okutenda ngeso. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Kwaanu anjili ao oku nyaziwa koo na kukung'oliwa kale, mukushweeka naaingene mukaci kenu. Kasa aanu a Nyambe, kame ashandola esishemo sa Nyambe wetu oku sitenda ouhule mi kame akana Jesu Kilesite Omolyetu ni Mbumu wetu. <verse eid="JUD 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Cwale kame ni singa oku mipulukisa Eyambo simba nji namu kwambeliwa mukwiyala moonje, nji woyo ona kuyoyisa aanu okutunda mu Engepita, munyima sebeli osinya awo na kwapumena. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Kame amangeloi no kwateula eitulo yawo, kono kame anasiiyi eibaka yawo naiteuliwa kwa yonyene mu mawenge na kwaabwa mu uwi okutwala ba liywaa linene no katulo. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Kanyi omo kuna kutendahalela mu Sodoma ni Gomola mane ni milenen̄i ikubapile nayo, eyo ina kutenda ouhule ni inu no kwa fanena, mbaitende omwanda okubita mukoto no mulilo no kwaabwa.<verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Naba kuli ngeeso aanu mukulota koo kame asilafaza etinyutu too, okukana aasimulonga mane ni kukana aa no kukanya. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Simba yonyene Mikaele onduna no mangeloi aba ana kuzeka ni Diyabulosi esitupu sa Mushe kasiku mwaatula mu ku munyefula kono sebeli wamba nji Mbumu aku kalimele. <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Kono aanu kame alwisa eyo kaalimukile, eyo ineyi mu mukwa no ku limukiwa mi ni iyamana kame itenda ngeso, kame asinyiwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Niti luli oumai ni woo, kakuli kame aenda mu ndila ya Kaine mi naaitukele okonga mulibaka no kuwana ku mafosisa a Balami, mane ni kusinyeha mu kufutuka kwa Kola. <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Awo ni anyefuli mu mikiti yenu no lilato, kame alya naanyi kanyi omulisani woyo okufepa feela yomboci. Kame akufekile kanyi amakumbi na mbulwa mbula, ao aendiswa ku mebo. Kame akufekile kanyi eitondo no mubebo eyi yulwile okubeeka mbuya, na mbulwa mamuna eyo ina kufa twiili ni kutuliwa mu mumbu. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Ni mandinda no liwate a timbelelwe alita olufulo no likenyi lyoo, Kame akufekile kanyi etinungweti eto tiyambaela eti tilukisetwe owilu no uwi no kwaabwa.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Na nuhiwa kwa Enoki no lusika no mutanu ni twiili (7) oku tateka kwa Adama aba na kunuha nji, “Komumone, Ombumu naiyi nawo aye no kukena aa abalwa emyanda-nda.” <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>Nji alite ekatulo kwaanu onje mane akalimele aanyefuli onje mulibaka no tikezo too no unyefuli tonje eto ana tende, ni ku maywi onje no kubambaba ao anaamba kwa yonyene awo asikutenda eibi. <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Naanu awo atongoka, ano ting'ananyi aata ni titakazo too, otunwa too kame aamba mu ukukumusa mane ni kubabaza aanu nji awane esinjili kwa onyene.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitemuso ni Titaelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Kono anyi aasingwa, kame mufanena okuhupula amaywi ana kwambiwa oweli kwa tumiwa a Mbumu wetu Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Aba ana ku myambela nji, mu tinako no mamaneneno aasiku nyefula mbaikalako, aata mu titakazo too eto tilwisa ounyambe. <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Okame aafapanisa aanu kame ali ni moyo no lutu fela, kakwite Emebo. <verse eid="JUD 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Kono anyi aasingwa mukuyakele mwenyene ba mutomo no tumelo yenu no kukena onene anyi mulapela ni mebo no kukena. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Mu ongotete mu lilato lya Nyambe, me mutatelele amakeke a Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite mu moyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Mukolwise akwenu awo alyangana, <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>mu yoyise akwenu okwa tundisa mu mulilo, anjili mwatende ni makeke mu kucila mi mutimbe ni ikumango no awo ali ni matilo no lutu.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo no Milumbeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Cwale kwa yonyene woyo otwesa oku mibabalela nji mulese kukwa, ni ku milita balubala no lubala lwaye no kanya me muwabelelwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>Kwa yonyene feela Nyambe omuyoyisi wetu mwa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu kwikale ekanya ni Umbumu ni maata noku busa okutunda kukale ni ba nako ino mane ni ku twala oku no kwaabwa! Ameni<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
